          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau's sons were Eliphaz, Reuel, Jeush, Jalam, and Korah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliphaz became the ancestor of the following tribes: Teman, Omar, Zephi, Gatam, Kenaz, Timna, and Amalek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Reuel became the ancestor of the tribes of Nahath, Zerah, Shammah, and Mizzah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.37"
            ]
